00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:53.460
Once your little Simba starts looking for a mate for himself, if they stick with the pride,

00:07:53.480 --> 00:07:58.740
there's a REALLY high chance that they're gonna be related to the female lioness they're starting to make googly eyes off of.

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:02.260
Meaning, the circle of life just got a whole lot more awkward.

00:08:02.260 --> 00:08:07.260
